\newlabel{tab:landscape}{{1}{4}{Positioning relative to adjacent literatures. ``Carrier'' = the geometric object kernels live on; ``Kernel'' = the fall-off function. SplineSplat swaps the kernel; we swap the carrier and derive its metric as kernel covariance. The cell marked \textbf {(ours)} is, to our knowledge, unoccupied}{table.caption.15}{}}
